    LLM: 'Choose Schlag (trump rank) and trump suit. Rechte (Schlag+suit) = top. Linke (other 3 Schlag) = next. Criticals: Maxi(K♥), Belli(7♦), Spitz(7♣) = permanent top trumps. NO suit obligation. Signaling between partners ALLOWED. Raising stakes possible (fold or accept).',
